  "description": "Western Goldrush is a bold vintage western display font inspired by classic cowboy typography, old saloon signage, wild west posters, and 19th-century American frontier aesthetics. This typeface features strong serif letterforms, decorative curves, dramatic swashes, and authentic western character details that bring a rustic, rugged, and masculine feel to any design.\n Perfect for barbershop branding, ranch logos, whiskey labels, saloon signage, western apparel, retro packaging, tattoo design, vintage posters, badge logo, headline typography, and classic Americana projects.\nWestern Goldrush comes with multiple uppercase letter variations that are directly accessible without using alternate features, making it easy to use for all designers on any software. The font is carefully crafted to deliver a bold statement look while maintaining readability and balance.\n Whether you’re creating cowboy branding, western logo design, rustic signage, vintage merchandise, or old west themed graphics, Western Goldrush adds a powerful frontier character and timeless western charm to your creative projects.",
  "fullDescription": "<p>Western Goldrush is a bold vintage western display font inspired by classic cowboy typography, old saloon signage, wild west posters, and 19th-century American frontier aesthetics. This typeface features strong serif letterforms, decorative curves, dramatic swashes, and authentic western character details that bring a rustic, rugged, and masculine feel to any design.</p>\n<p> Perfect for barbershop branding, ranch logos, whiskey labels, saloon signage, western apparel, retro packaging, tattoo design, vintage posters, badge logo, headline typography, and classic Americana projects.</p>\n<p>Western Goldrush comes with multiple uppercase letter variations that are directly accessible without using alternate features, making it easy to use for all designers on any software. The font is carefully crafted to deliver a bold statement look while maintaining readability and balance.</p>\n<p> Whether you’re creating cowboy branding, western logo design, rustic signage, vintage merchandise, or old west themed graphics, Western Goldrush adds a powerful frontier character and timeless western charm to your creative projects.</p>",
